        "UnscramblWords is a free, browser-based word finder — no download, no account needed. It supports 10 languages (English, Spanish, French, German, Portuguese, Italian, Turkish, Russian, Polish, and Arabic), each using that language's own accented and special characters correctly rather than stripping them out. You can filter results by starting letter, ending letter, contains, required letter, and length, all from a single screen.",
